OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: The Venetian
OL,6,G     School
OL,7,     F4/5. Following a devastating
OL,8,     Fplague, Donald Macleod explores
OL,9,     Fthe glory years of the Venetian
OL,10,     FSchool and the music of the
OL,11,     FGabrielis - Andrea and his nephew
OL,12,     FGiovanni.
OL,13,G1700 In Tune
OL,14,     FLutenist Toby Carr performs live.
OL,15,     FConductor Anthony Parnther and
OL,16,     Fcomposer David Onac discuss the
OL,17,     Fworld premiere of Onac's Atlantic
OL,18,     FRequiem with the London Symphony
OL,19,     FOrchestra.
